---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import { u } from "../lib/u";
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy — CourseDepth" description="How CourseDepth handles your data when you read our Udemy course reviews or write one.">
<Header />
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>How CourseDepth handles your data when you read our Udemy course reviews or write one.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:760px">
<h2>What we collect</h2>
<p>We do not require an account to browse. When you submit a review we collect the email address you provide plus the review content. Basic anonymous usage data (pages visited, referrer, device type) may be collected through privacy-friendly analytics.</p>
<h2>How we use it</h2>
<p>To publish and moderate reviews, respond to your messages, and understand which course pages are most useful so we can improve the site.</p>
<h2>Cookies</h2>
<p>We use only essential cookies to keep the site working. We do not use third-party advertising cookies.</p>
<h2>Sharing</h2>
<p>We never sell your personal data. Course providers do not receive your email address or your browsing history. Review content is public by design.</p>
<h2>Your rights</h2>
<p>You can request a copy of your data or ask us to delete it at any time via the contact page. We respond within 30 days.</p>
<h2>Retention</h2>
<p>We keep submitted reviews until you ask us to remove them. Server logs are rotated automatically.</p>
<p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin-top:28px">Questions? <a href="/contact" style="font-weight:700">Contact us</a> — read more in our <a href="/about-us" style="font-weight:700">about page</a>.</p>
</div></section>
<Footer />
</Layout>
